          "tag": "h2",
          "text": "What Guides Every Decision We Make",
          "where": "main"
        },
        {
          "tag": "p",
          "text": "Before any organization receives funding through Kind Footprint, it passes our proprietary SITES evaluation, five criteria that ensure every dollar creates real, lasting humanitarian impact:",
